@* Sidebar de navegacion del Web cliente - estilo NexLink (rail + tab-content).
   Mapeo de los 25 modulos PROPIA en 6 grupos del rail:
   - Inicio (Dashboard 2.2)
   - Mi PH (2.3 + 2.4 + 2.5)
   - Finanzas (2.6 + 2.7)
   - Gobierno y convivencia (2.8 + 2.9)
   - Operacion (2.10 + 2.11 + 2.12 + 2.13)
   - Comunicacion (2.14 + 2.15 + 2.16)
   Adicionales: Capa 1 (Organizacion) y Mi cuenta. *@

@* === Rail (iconos verticales, 80px ancho) === *@
<div class="app-navbar-tabs" data-simplebar>
    <ul class="nav" id="appMenubarTabs" role="tablist" aria-orientation="vertical">

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Inicio">
            <a class="menu-link active" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabInicio">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-house-blank"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Mi copropiedad">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabMiPH">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-building"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Finanzas">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabFinanzas">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-usd-circle"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Gobierno y convivencia">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabGobierno">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-podium-star"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Operacion">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabOperacion">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-list-check"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Comunicacion">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabComunicacion">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-megaphone"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item-hr"></li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Organizacion (Capa 1)">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabOrg">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-network"></i>
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="right" data-bs-title="Mi cuenta">
            <a class="menu-link" href="javascript:void(0)" data-tab-target="tabCuenta">
                <i class="fi fi-rr-user"></i>
            </a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>

